@startuml
title Process Sale State Transition Diagram

[*] --> WaitingForSale : Start

state "Waiting for sale" as WaitingForSale
state "Adding items" as AddingItems
state "Payment required" as PaymentRequired
state "Verifying payment" as VerifyingPayment
state "Sale completed" as SaleCompleted

WaitingForSale --> AddingItems : customer arrives

AddingItems --> PaymentRequired : all items added

PaymentRequired --> SaleCompleted : cash payment chosen
PaymentRequired --> VerifyingPayment : card or check chosen

VerifyingPayment --> SaleCompleted : payment approved

SaleCompleted --> WaitingForSale : sale finished

@enduml
